### C1) Manager 1 tries to create a receptionist in building 2   # EXPECT 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register-receptionist
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{piotrToken}}

{ "firstName": "Wrong", "lastName": "Building", "email": "wrong.building@dorm.local", "password": "Recept@123", "buildingId": 2 }

